{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_signup

    Signing up for an open day or a visit from the phone of the family. On the wall, who would come: with the first
    letter of a name, the backpack arrives at its hook and its label is written. Then the event and who will receive
    them; the course, the adults, the turn, a few things more, how to write to them, the first layer about their data
    and the check against robots. One main action: «Apuntarnos». Works without JavaScript: the rows waiting to be added
    show, and the turns, chips and the number of people are real inputs.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "i": {"plus": "", "alert": "", "check": ""}, "base": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/pub/", "version": 1,
        "event": "Jornada de puertas abiertas", "pub_come_meet": "Vengan a conocernos",
        "pegs": {"count": 1, "live": true, "pegs": [{"index": 0, "name": "", "style": "", "arrive": false,
            "delay": "0.15", "hidden": false}]},
        "asksiblings": false, "children": [{"index": 0, "hidden": false, "first": true, "namelabel": "¿Cómo se llama quien vendría?",
            "name": "", "nameerror": "", "tag": "", "tagplaceholder": "", "courselabel": "¿En qué curso empezaría?",
            "coursewith": "¿En qué curso empezaría {name}?", "coursewithout": "¿En qué curso empezaría?",
